+/// Deviation, for a crate on top (a gamepad's crosshair): while the camera turns (mouselook), the
+/// hover picks aim at this viewport point instead of yielding, so the mouseover, its tooltip and
+/// the cursor's interact grade follow the crosshair. 1.12 has no pointer during mouselook. Absent,
+/// or `None`, the picks yield as the reference's do.
+#[derive(Resource, Default, Clone, Copy, Debug)]
+pub struct LookAim(pub Option<Vec2>);
